        "raw": "<p>The penultimatude is pleasing. :3 Though Adam's going to come back for an Editor's Note and then immediately get a week off? What a bum!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Kudos to DJ Romance for answering my question before it was even asked!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope I never incur the ire of Jodie. c.c;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We need to turn this \"whose powers/backstory do you want\" question into a community thing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I wonder if Adam will have to deal with metameta questions upon his return, and what form they will take. Or is he gonna be sitting there wondering why everyone just wants to ask questions about Star Trek?</p>",
